<h2>1. Prohibited Actions</h2>
<p>Visitors and automated bots interacting with <code>aimadulislam.dpdns.org</code> must NOT engage in any of the following activities:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Aggressive web scraping or crawling that exceeds 60 requests per minute.</li>
    <li>Automated vulnerability scanning with tools such as Acunetix, Nikto, or Nessus without pre-approval.</li>
    <li>Submitting malicious code payloads, cross-site scripting strings, or SQL payloads into public contact forms.</li>
    <li>Impersonating site administrators or security personnel.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Automated Enforcement</h2>
<p>IP addresses exceeding rate thresholds or triggering WAF rules will automatically be rate-limited or blocked by Cloudflare edge filters.</p>
